      "ancestry": "2192c8fb-1e01-5177-89a1-378ed80794d7"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "29db2bad-04ad-5f32-8ac7-810433e242d5",
    "pack": "impossible-lands",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:cataphract-fleshwarp",
    "name": "Cataphract Fleshwarp",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "impossible-lands",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Heritages.aspx?ID=204",
        "page": 28
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your battle-hardened skeleton is laced with additional cartilage and muscle to help bear armor across vast areas of operation, and your skin is bedecked with tiny spurs of pliable, resilient keratin to optimize the grip and weight distribution of your armor. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "e1672739-83e2-5940-8dbd-2fef4aaf5e14"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " feat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If your class makes you trained in all types of armor, you instead become trained in Athletics (or a skill of your choice if you're already trained in Athletics) and gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "e7d969d3-deed-5b62-992b-44469b3b063f"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " skill feat."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "e1672739-83e2-5940-8dbd-2fef4aaf5e14"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.PQuJEYI0UFl8W7fH"
    },
    "data": {}
  },
  {
    "id": "983ecbb4-729d-58a0-a2c8-d5498c97cdd0",
    "pack": "impossible-lands",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:discarded-fleshwarp",
    "name": "Discarded Fleshwarp",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "impossible-lands",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Heritages.aspx?ID=205",
        "page": 28
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The biomancers and mutagenists who warped your form labeled you a \"discard on discovery\"—a euphemism for destroying you on sight. An anomaly among anomalies, your body stubbornly repudiates the efforts of fleshcrafters seeking to mold you to their grandiose visions, and your immune responses blunt the worst effects of unwanted fleshwarping attempts. If you roll a success on a saving throw against a transmutation effect, you get a critical success instead."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.heritages.Item.OtqOC3ElpF444qMe"
    },
    "data": {}
  },
  {
    "id": "0451eee8-7efd-5826-9073-3c8ca48fc2c0",
    "pack": "impossible-lands",
    "kind": "heritage",
    "slug": "heritage:elusive-vishkanya",
    "name": "Elusive Vishkanya",
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": [],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "impossible-lands",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Heritages.aspx?ID=225",
        "page": 60
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Your flexible body seems unnaturally fluid to some, though they can rarely put a finger on what seems strange about you. You can escape foes with ease. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to checks to "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "2ae74030-e87a-55ee-955c-fb9870392d44"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Additionally, you move twice as fast when Squeezing."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["skill:athletics", "skill:acrobatics"],
        "type": "circumstance",
        "value": 1,
        "predicate": ["action:escape"]
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
